WEBVTT

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:02.668
Right now across the Arctic,

00:07:02.668 --> 00:07:06.881
people are having to make
extremely difficult decisions

00:07:06.881 --> 00:07:09.175
about where and how to live

00:07:09.175 --> 00:07:11.802
in order to protect
themselves and their families

00:07:11.802 --> 00:07:13.721
from the hazards of climate change.

00:07:14.346 --> 00:07:16.640
So we’re working with our team members

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.185
and our partners who live on permafrost

00:07:19.185 --> 00:07:21.979
to bring these monitoring
and modeling tools

00:07:21.979 --> 00:07:26.442
to assess the current and future impacts
of permafrost thaw on Arctic communities,

00:07:26.442 --> 00:07:28.819
and to co-create adaptation plans

00:07:28.819 --> 00:07:32.072
that protect and respect the health,